1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,580
Two AI agents, two branches.

2
00:00:01,580 --> 00:00:03,951
Both pull requests are green against main.

3
00:00:03,951 --> 00:00:05,757
Merge one, and the other breaks.

4
00:00:06,567 --> 00:00:07,528
Here is why.

5
00:00:07,528 --> 00:00:10,650
Both rewrite the same lines of auth.ts.

6
00:00:11,967 --> 00:00:13,241
And git only finds out at merge.

7
00:00:14,533 --> 00:00:15,877
Bullpen stops it before it happens.

8
00:00:17,667 --> 00:00:18,323
You type one ask.

9
00:00:20,133 --> 00:00:21,693
Three Claude Code agents start work,

10
00:00:21,693 --> 00:00:22,690
each on its own branch.

11
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,548
Two of them want the same file.

12
00:00:25,548 --> 00:00:26,447
One gets the lock.

13
00:00:27,733 --> 00:00:28,729
The other waits in line,

14
00:00:28,729 --> 00:00:29,807
so nothing is overwritten.

15
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:32,355
A guarded folder needs a human.

16
00:00:32,355 --> 00:00:33,610
Bullpen shows an approval card.

17
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:35,769
Deny it, and the agent

18
00:00:35,769 --> 00:00:36,638
writes a plan instead.

19
00:00:37,933 --> 00:00:39,508
Don't like one agent's work?

20
00:00:39,508 --> 00:00:40,408
Undo that agent.

21
00:00:40,408 --> 00:00:41,927
Only its branch rolls back.

22
00:00:43,033 --> 00:00:43,890
Happy with another?

23
00:00:43,890 --> 00:00:44,656
Merge it to main.

24
00:00:46,467 --> 00:00:47,918
The other branches sync with it at once.

25
00:00:49,633 --> 00:00:51,097
Every edit is checked by a referee,

26
00:00:51,097 --> 00:00:52,938
on separate hardware the agents can't touch.

27
00:00:54,233 --> 00:00:56,518
Pause the referee, and every edit is denied.

28
00:00:56,518 --> 00:00:57,348
It fails closed.

29
00:00:58,633 --> 00:01:00,005
And every edit is a commit, tagged

30
00:01:00,005 --> 00:01:01,135
with the agent that made it.

31
00:01:02,433 --> 00:01:04,051
Git finds the conflict at merge.

32
00:01:04,051 --> 00:01:05,670
Bullpen decides before the edit.

33
00:01:06,667 --> 00:01:07,798
Git tracks what changed.

34
00:01:07,798 --> 00:01:09,873
Bullpen controls who's allowed to change it.
